    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδια-τρίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waste time,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.49
			</span></i>; <i>spend time,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ ὀρχηστάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					54.17
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>detain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				44.19
			</span></i>; <i>defer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χειροτονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					2.20
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>delay,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>divert,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖρας ἀπὸ τῶν σφαγῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					77.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
